ghlight>Tell el Kâdî</highlight>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Rob')\">Rob<sup>BR iii. 351, 358</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bäd')\">Bd<sup>Pa1 265</sup></lookup>. This place is frequently referred to: <ref ref=\"Gen 14:14\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(1,14,14)\">Gen 14:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 34:1\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(5,34,1)\">Deut 34:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 12:29\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(11,12,29)\">1Kgs 12:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 12:30\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(11,12,30)\">1Kgs 12:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 15:20\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(11,15,20)\">1Kgs 15:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 10:29\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(12,10,29)\">2Kgs 10:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 16:4\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(14,16,4)\">2Chr 16:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 4:15\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(24,4,15)\">Jer 4:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 8:16\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(24,8,16)\">Jer 8:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Amos 8:14\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(30,8,14)\">Amos 8:14</ref> read also <bdbheb>וּבְדָן</bdbheb> for <bdbheb>וְכֵן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 20:18\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(10,20,18)\">2Sam 20:18</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup>; and see the phrase <bdbheb>מִדָּן וְעַדבְּֿאֵר שֶׁבַע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 20:1\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"1